<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>openac-rust third-party licenses</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 60rem; padding: 1rem; line-height: 1.4; }
  h1 { margin-top: 0; }
  ul.used-by { columns: 3 12rem; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; overflow-x: auto; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    body { background: #1b1b1b; color: #ddd; }
    a { color: #8ab4f8; }
    pre { background: #262626; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>openac-rust is under the MIT license (see <code>LICENSE</code>; attributions
are in <code>NOTICE.md</code> and the font licenses in <code>licenses/</code>).
The programs in this package also contain the following Rust crates, each
listed under the license it is used under.</p>

<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

<h2>License texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<section>
  <h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
  <p>Used by:</p>
  <ul class="used-by">
  {{#each used_by}}
    <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
  {{/each}}
  </ul>
  <pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</main>
</body>
</html>
